id: weapon-summoner
name: Weapon Summoner
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score 8+
tpCost: 5
summonsWeapons: true
source: Core Rule
text: >
  Weapon Summoner: You can conjure weapons with ease.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score 8+
  –TP Cost: 5 TP
  –Effect: You automatically succeed each Use Magic Skill Check to make a Weapon with a Craftsmanship
  Grade equal to or lower than your number of Use Magic Skill Ranks. You can dismiss any Weapon you’ve
  created with Magical Materialization as an Instant Maneuver OR as part of Magical Materialization in
  addition to its other effects.

---

# Weapons are said on the card (the user's ruling): so are its automatic success and its dismissal.
